.TH "DNF5-CHECK" "8" "Sep 06, 2026" "" "dnf5"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dnf5-check \- Check Command
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBdnf5 check [options]\fP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Checks the local packagedb and produces information on any problems it finds.
The set of checks performed can be specified with options.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \fB\-\-dependencies\fP
.nf
Show missing dependencies and conflicts.
.fi
.sp
.TP
.B \fB\-\-duplicates\fP
.nf
Show duplicated packages.
.fi
.sp
.TP
.B \fB\-\-obsoleted\fP
.nf
Show obsoleted packages.
.fi
.sp
.UNINDENT
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \fBdnf5 check\fP
.nf
Show all problems.
.fi
.sp
.TP
.B \fBdnf5 check \-\-dependencies \-\-obsoleted\fP
.nf
Show missing dependencies, conflicts and obsoleted packages.
.fi
.sp
.UNINDENT
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
See AUTHORS.md in dnf5 source distribution.
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
Contributors to the dnf5 project.
